@a9i5k4/dsh-auto-memory README · Why a plugin：**One route, two arrivals: it ships with a flagship; ours walks into your machine as a plugin.**

*Handoff is on by default — threshold 0.75, just below the host's 0.80 auto-compaction line (see [How she hands off](#how-she-hands-off)).*

